## Root Cause
Arrow function generics in .tsx files are parsed as JSX:
```typescript
// BROKEN - <T> looks like JSX
subscribe: <T>(channel: string, callback: (data: T) => void) => {...}

// FIX Option 1: Add constraint to disambiguate
subscribe: <T extends unknown>(channel: string, callback: (data: T) => void) => {...}

// FIX Option 2: Use function keyword
subscribe: function<T>(channel: string, callback: (data: T) => void) {...}

// FIX Option 3: Extract to named function
function subscribe<T>(channel: string, callback: (data: T) => void) {...}
```

