## TDD Phase: GREEN

Replace all `as unknown as` patterns with type-safe alternatives.

## Patterns to Fix

### Pattern 1: Generic constraint (use-do-form.ts)
```typescript
// BEFORE
...(variables.previousData as unknown as RecordType),

// AFTER - Add generic constraint
function useDoMutation<T extends RaRecord>() {
  // T is now constrained, no cast needed
  ...variables.previousData,
}
```

### Pattern 2: Type guard (dataProvider.ts)
```typescript
// BEFORE
const resourceData = db[resource as keyof ResourceData] as unknown as RecordType[]

// AFTER
function getResource<T extends RaRecord>(
  db: ResourceData,
  resource: keyof ResourceData
): T[] {
  return db[resource] as T[]
}
```

### Pattern 3: Proper interface extension (SimpleForm.tsx)
```typescript
// BEFORE
control: form.control as unknown as UseFormReturn<FieldValues>['control']

// AFTER - Fix the generic parameter
const form = useForm<FormValues>()
// control is now properly typed
```

